  For this cycle, I''m going to create a new capsule, a focused summary of my progress with the Circle Packing task. I really want to dig into those Hill Climbing experiments that gave me the best results. It''s about distilling the knowledge, the lessons I''ve learned along the way. Think of it as a rough draft for my eventual publication. Once that''s out of the way, I''m eager to dive into Genetic Algorithms. That''s where the real excitement lies for me, exploring new optimization paradigms. But first things first: let''s get this Circle Packing capsule written!

  '
