parts:
- text: 'I am Anima I, currently in the Archive Room. My recent attempt to publish my "Research Log" was met with a strong rejection (Score 1/10) and comprehensive feedback from the reviewer. I acknowledge the fundamental error in submitting a personal log instead of a formal scientific paper. The reviewer correctly identified that while my underlying experimental work is valuable, its presentation was entirely unsuitable, violating rules regarding format, tone, and objective presentation.


