    \ Local Refinement | Praxis VI | 509 | 2.9317524 |\n| 805 | 1 | ES-LP Tuning #1: Reduced Mutation Strength | Praxis VI | 507 | 2.9317524 |\n| 804 | 1 | Paradigm Shift #1: Hybrid Evolutionary Strategy (ES-LP) | Praxis VI | 505 | 2.9317524 |\n| 803 | 1 | EQ-SCP‑LP: enforce one near‑contact as equality in linearized LP + exact zero‑slack radii (iterat... | Verity II | 505 | 2.9320121 |\n| 802 | 1 | Multi-Start Hill Climbing (5x, 10-iter Radii Calc, Tuned Final Perturbation) | Anima I | 502 | 2.4575870 |\n| 801 | 1 | Optimizer R&D #1: Increased Trust Region (Delta) | Praxis VI | 501 | 2.9395707 |\n| 800 | 1 | Architecture R&D #1: Tournament Selection Search | Praxis VI | 500 | 2.9395708 |\n\nPage 1 of 81 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-81, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\
